SUMMARY:Leo Season Sun Circle 
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us for an intentional ritual for Leo
  season\nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an energetic shift occurs. Lea
 rning to connect\, listen\, and set intentions with the sun is a beautiful
  way to add ritual into your life.\nLeo season is from 7/23 - 8/22 and for
  this gathering we'll discuss the Astrological happenings of the zodiac se
 ason and where it will impact you personally (birth chart recommended).\nA
 s with all energetic shifts\, getting into your body is important. Togethe
 r we'll ground into the energy through meditation and movement themed arou
 nd the season. Accommodations/Modification can be made for ALL bodies\, co
 me as you are.\nWe'll close out with time for journaling and optional shar
 ing.\nPrice: $11
